    {
      "id": "FQ07",
      "finding": "MaxHitPoints has no Quality part. Wood factor .65 yields Bed91, DiningChair65, Table1x2c49 and HorseshoesPin49 after integer rounding. Frame health is separate and finished health preserves its fraction with ceiling.",
