    {
      "id": "FQ08",
      "finding": "Comfort factors Awful..Legendary .76,.88,1,1.12,1.24,1.45,1.7 multiply bed .75 or chair .70. Table/pin define no comfort. Stat quality transforms only positive inputs by default, with min(multiplier gain,maxGain). Furniture comfort above1 is distinct from a need-level cap.",
