      "finding": "Stuff-built furniture base market value is material amount*stuff market value/VolumePerUnit plus .0036*max(WorkToBuild,WorkToMake) when work>2, divided by productCount. Wood WorkToBuild factor.7 gives bed560; value=54+2.016=56.016 before quality. UI formatted money is not full precision.",
