      "finding": "WealthWatcher colony building wealth uses MarketValueIgnoreHp; RoomStatWorker_Wealth uses ordinary thing.MarketValue. Both can reflect quality, but only the latter reflects current damage. A new quality roll can affect storyteller wealth without a general damage discount to building wealth.",
